Xiri-specific resources
=======================

This directory holds artwork, theme assets and supporting material specific
to the Xiri fork that do not have a natural home in the NetBSD source layout.
Kernel code, drivers, userland programs and their tests use the usual NetBSD
directories.

graphics/ contains the SGI console artwork, its editable GIMP source, the
initial and framed console themes, and the tools used to generate their
runtime and compiled-in images.  See graphics/README for editing, regeneration
and validation instructions.

The normal build installs the theme files through share/wscons/themes/Makefile
at /usr/share/wscons/themes.  No separate build of this directory is needed.
